{
  "type": "regulator_78xx",
  "name": "Voltage regulator (78xx)",
  "category": "Integrated circuits",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Fixed positive regulator like the 7805 (set Vout for 7809, 7812...): OUT stays at Vout above GND while IN is at least Vdo higher; the input current is the load current plus about 5 mA; behavioral: no thermal shutdown, no ripple rejection limit, no capacitors needed for stability",
  "symbol": {
